          "message": {
            "text": "HWPX limits bound compressed artifacts but not peak archive-expansion memory\n\nCompressed input and final output are capped, but decompressed entries and peak allocation are not.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion document export\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nValidate entry count, total uncompressed bytes, and maximum entry size before decompression; enforce peak-memory and streaming caps.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject over-budget archive before getData.\n- Validate template manifest in CI.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Separate compressed/uncompressed budgets.\n- Audit binary assets in CI."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:775d13b6327b6dbd2248e9591c882738c8216d8000b03f33c4c9cad97e4a7ae8"
