          "message": {
            "text": "Direct improvement approval forgery can poison tenant harness memory\n\nOwners can set improvement approval metadata while harness memory trusts approved or reflected rows.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Authorization bypass generation integrity\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nMake approval fields server-only and require an immutable review receipt.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for improvement-review-forgery.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
