          "message": {
            "text": "Disconnected safety-status requests release admission while underlying work continues\n\nThe abort wrapper rejects and releases its lease while three operations without AbortSignal continue.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion cancellation\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nPropagate AbortSignal to every operation or retain the lease until Promise.all settles.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Abort after start and assert lease remains until settlement.\n- Verify disconnects cannot exceed concurrency.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Require cancellation-aware protected APIs.\n- Test actual work lifetime."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:0c784234cadca20405e2658184c07b6eeaec6af3e5cf5c59a2c3e4f5ce78a1e5"
