          "message": {
            "text": "Tenant owners can forge knowledge approval and review-receipt state\n\nOwner FOR ALL policies permit direct writes to review status, provider attribution, output, and receipts.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Authorization bypass governance integrity\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nRevoke direct approval-field writes and use a transactional SECURITY DEFINER review RPC.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for knowledge-review-forgery.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:31e2340a451194a69eced34fb222f61afccbc8816049231a0c9e87593bd547d0"
