                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Share acknowledgement admission occurs after unauthenticated body consumption\n\nThe public ACK route reads and parses up to 16 KiB for up to ten seconds before distributed admission.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nAcquire a coarse distributed IP rate/concurrency lease before body reads, retaining the recipient-specific limiter after parsing.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Assert coarse admission precedes body reader.\n- Verify parallel slow bodies are rejected.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Centralize public pre-body admission.\n- Add route-order tests."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:b8323758b0d432f40eb7d548702e9452706f5cb7d8438111b1b14ff010fedeee"
