          "message": {
            "text": "Public RLS exposes complete safety-reference bodies and payloads\n\nRaw safety-reference rows include body and payload while public SELECT bypasses the bounded API projection.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Information exposure corpus boundary\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-200\n\nRemediation:\nRemove anon SELECT and expose an approved bounded view.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for raw-safety-corpus.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
