          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Documents table is exposed without row-level security\n\nMigration 001 creates document bodies and citations without RLS; normal Supabase grants can expose direct REST access if deployed.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Missing authorization RLS\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nEnable RLS, revoke broad grants, and add least-privilege tenant policies.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for documents-no-rls.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:c16f1ff3bdfd4ee4bb0312f6833e3c79028ffe10fd2ab0c3edae0a1c156aa420"
          },
