                  "startLine": 14
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "MCP token quota check and issuance are non-atomic\n\nConcurrent issuance calls can all pass a separate count check and insert past the cap.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Race condition credential issuance\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-362\n\nRemediation:\nUse a locked transactional recount-and-insert RPC.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for mcp-token-quota-race.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:579d68e1ee0f95866c53ce326974ddcebe60cd38c9a63be959429008c8760a04"
          },
          "properties": {
