          "message": {
            "text": "Owners can forge provider dispatch receipts through direct PostgREST\n\nThe owner FOR ALL dispatch_logs policy exposes provider receipt fields to direct tenant writes.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Data authenticity audit integrity\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-345\n\nRemediation:\nRevoke tenant mutation rights and write receipts only through a server path.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for provider-receipt-forgery.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
